        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Damage</strong> 1d8 impact; <strong>Range</strong> Melee; <strong>Traits</strong> Discreet, Unique; <strong>Expert Traits</strong> Offhand;</p><p><strong>Type</strong> Special Weapon; <strong>Weapons Skill</strong> Heavy or Light; <strong>Price</strong> 40 bx; <strong>Weight</strong> 3 lb;</p><p></p><p>A favorite of hazekillers, dueling canes are wooden canes crafted to withstand combat despite appearing as a standard walking cane. Their weight and size are precisely designed to accommodate a wide variety of fighting styles.</p><p><strong>Unique Trait.</strong> Dueling canes have the following unique trait:</p><p><strong>Flexible Fighting.</strong> You can use either the Heavy Weaponry or Light Weaponry skill with a dueling cane.</p>",
